# Files git should NOT upload. Only things the build makes are listed here; all source code,
# pictures, docs and settings are part of the repo. Change this list to suit your own fork.

# Build results: made by build.sh, so they don't belong in the source
*.exe
*.res
*.sha256

# The PawnIO installer: a third-party file, downloaded by build.sh from PawnIO's official release
# and checked against its SHA-256 (see THIRD_PARTY.md), so it isn't stored here
src/installer/pawnio/

# Previews that tools/make-icon.ps1 writes next to itself
tools/*.png
